{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOLY COW!</strong></h2>Abduct as many cows as possible!  Zoom around alien planets, luring and stealing cows from opponent UFOs while stopping them from taking your own.  Set records and unlock achievements in a variety of single-player and multiplayer game modes as you grow your very own <i>Alien Cow Farm</i>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALIEN POWERS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ABDUCT</strong> cows and return them to your barn to score!<br></li><li><strong>SHOOT</strong> opponents to steal their cows!<br></li><li>Deploy <strong>DRONES</strong> to defend your barn!<br></li><li>Drop <strong>LURES</strong> to attract nearby cows!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEVEN GAME MODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>CLASSIC</strong> - Abduct as many cows as possible before time runs out!<br></li><li><strong>TIME TRIAL</strong> - Abduct the target number of cows as quickly as possible!<br></li><li><strong>CAPTURE THE COW</strong> - One cow starts in each barn and teleports back there after being abducted.  Steal the target number!<br></li><li><strong>SURVIVAL</strong> - Time is added to your individual clock with each abduction.  Don't let it run out!<br></li><li><strong>HUNT</strong> - Only one cow on the entire map!  It teleports away after being captured, so find and abduct it as many times as possible before time runs out!<br></li><li><strong>FRENZY</strong> - Play with an extreme number of cows on the map!  With no stealing allowed, the game ends when they've all been abducted!<br></li><li><strong>ELIMINATION</strong> - Cows start in each barn, but there are none wandering on the map!  Steal quickly because any player with zero cows at the end of each round gets knocked out!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set Records and unlock Achievements in single-player mode, or challenge your friends in multiplayer!</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2a16ca88c7ad2b7043875f0ce11664a8537ef4b9.jpg","localized_name":"Cow-abunga!","name":"Cow-abunga!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/2a16ca88c7ad2b7043875f0ce11664a8537ef4b9.jpg"},{"icon":"b029e87bdfb0d82b3f861d47b4ec7d1a857778e7.jpg","localized_name":"In One Ear And Out The Udder","name":"In One Ear And Out The Udder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/b029e87bdfb0d82b3f861d47b4ec7d1a857778e7.jpg"},{"icon":"a30c1bdfaddea84eee8ad48c42bc098877f84528.jpg","localized_name":"Hoofing It","name":"Hoofing It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/a30c1bdfaddea84eee8ad48c42bc098877f84528.jpg"},{"icon":"22f34bfb399094377a2e398fcb20b269b2249e9f.jpg","localized_name":"Well-Done!","name":"Well-Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/22f34bfb399094377a2e398fcb20b269b2249e9f.jpg"},{"icon":"84c2d382f0f78718091f992f9a686b213985bf43.jpg","localized_name":"Greener Pastures","name":"Greener Pastures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/84c2d382f0f78718091f992f9a686b213985bf43.jpg"},{"icon":"851106f0ffa2a39e718f606472eb7d859c2a4b95.jpg","localized_name":"Milked For All It's Worth","name":"Milked For All It's Worth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/851106f0ffa2a39e718f606472eb7d859c2a4b95.jpg"},{"icon":"8bf20c2aab998ed2b4edd9f0d4fa7fff82eb0306.jpg","localized_name":"Pretty Cow-lors","name":"Pretty Cow-lors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1036620/8bf20c2aab998ed2b4edd9f0d4fa7fff82eb0306.jpg"},{"icon":"f734672b0ae1f8f2862b16b1021963d2448f5d3b.jpg","localized_name":"Udder-ly Satisfying","name":"Udder-ly Satisfying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a